 (See Ex-\n\nample 4.9 in [13]).\n\nMoreover, our approach is steadily extendable to a more general setting.\n\nIn fact, we have the following result.\n\nTheorem 1.3. For any compact ﬁnite-dimensional Alexandrov space X of\n\nnonnegative curvature and any natural number k, we have\n\nλ k(X)≤16 e\n\ne−12\n\nk 2 λ 1(X).(5)\n\nThis veriﬁes a strong version of the Conjecture 6.11 in Funano-Shioya\n\n[13].\n\n1.1. An approach via Cheeger constant. We prove Theorem 1.1 by\n\nconnecting λ 1(M, µ) with λ k(M , µ) via Cheeger constant h 1(M , µ).\n\nThe ﬁrst ingredient is due to a recent progress of Kwok-Lau-Lee-Gharan-\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPiotr W. Nowak: Curriculum Vitae (https://pnowak.impan.pl/ewExternalFiles/cv-7.pdf)\nciteturn12search15 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.1 years ago; Kaluba and P. ... Kielak) *On property (T) for Aut(F\\_n) and SL\\_n(Z)* ... Ozawa) *Aut(F\\_5) has property (T)*\nPiotr W. Nowak                                                                 3\n\nArticles\n\n1. (with D. Kielak) *Coboundary expansion and Gromov hyperbolicity*, preprint  \n2. (with A. Oliynik and V. Prokhorchuk) *On (bi)reversible automata generating lamplighter groups*, preprint  \n3. (with P. Mizerka) *On order units in the augmentation ideal*  \n   Proceedings of the American Mathematical Society, to appear.  \n4. (with M. Kaluba and P. Mizerka) *Spectral gap for the cohomological Laplacian of SL\\_3(Z)*, preprint  \n5. (with K. Li and S. Pooya) *Higher Kazhdan projections, ℓ\\_2-Betti numbers and Baum-Connes conjectures*  \n   Journal of Noncommutative Geometry, to appear  \n6. (with U. Bader) *Group algebra criteria for vanishing of cohomology*  \n   Journal of Functional Analysis, Vol. 279, Issue 11, 2020, 108730.  \n7. (with M. Kaluba and D. Kielak) *On property (T) for Aut(F\\_n) and SL\\_n(Z)*  \n   Annals of Mathematics 193 (2021), Issue 2, p. 539–562.  \n8. (with K. Li, J. Špakula, J. Zhang) *Quasi-loc